+/// and with a value ([`ParsedArgs::parse_exact`]), so a second `--upload-id` is refused (the grant
+/// admits one session per invocation); a stray positional, as `wyrd custodian` refuses one; and
+/// `--data-dir` on a networked backend, which would read it and then ignore it.
